    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Get a quote</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Fixed fee</p>\n<h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Get a fixed-fee quote</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Tell us what you need and we&#8217;ll come back with one price, in writing, before any work starts. Individual returns start at $99. Company, partnership, trust and SMSF returns, bookkeeping and business setups are quoted on what&#8217;s actually there, usually within one business day. The quote is free; before any work starts, every client completes a three-minute online <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">identity check</a>, included in the fee.</p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-10\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Turnaround</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\"> One business day </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Most quotes go out the same day. Complex groups may take a little longer. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">No obligation</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\"> Nothing charged to ask </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> The quote is free, and nothing is charged until you approve the finished work. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Who does it</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">A registered tax agent</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> BRS Advisory Pty Ltd, agent 26233684, CPA Australia Public Practice. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">Every client ID-verified</a> before work starts. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12\">\n<div class=\"card overflow-hidden p-2 sm:p-4\"> <iframe id=\"JotFormIFrame-262643467173058\" src=\"https://form.jotform.com/262643467173058\" title=\"Get a quote — enquiry form for XYZ Accounting\" class=\"block w-full border-0\" style=\"min-width:100%;max-width:100%;height:900px;border:none;\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe><br />\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jotfor.ms/s/umd/latest/for-form-embed-handler.js\"></script><br />\n<script>window.jotformEmbedHandler(\"iframe[id='JotFormIFrame-262643467173058']\", \"https://form.jotform.com/\")</script> </div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Form not loading? <a href=\"https://form.jotform.com/262643467173058\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Open it in a new tab</a>, or call 0407 179 179. Please don&#8217;t include tax file numbers. </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Already know what you need?</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem]\">Individual returns are a fixed $99 and don&#8217;t need a quote. <a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Start your return in the client portal</a> and nothing is charged until it&#8217;s lodged.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"/online-tax-returns/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">All return types</a><a href=\"/services/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Pricing</a><a href=\"/services/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Services</a><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Contact Us</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n"
